    <string name="scroll_service_description">Used only by Akshar\'s read-aloud modes: \"Speak with auto-scroll\" scrolls the app you are reading after a section is read, and \"Speak with pagination\" presses the Next Page button you pinned after a page is read. It looks only for that scrollable area or button, does not read, store or send screen content, and does nothing while you are not using these modes. Turn it off here at any time.</string>
